 The matcher currently clones capture state on backtracking and has no compiled/DFA
-path. Profile representative successful, failing, catastrophic, lookaround,
-backreference, and UnicodeSet patterns before changing the model. Any optimization must
+path. Compilation has a second cost now: a `v`-mode class under `i` applies
+MaybeSimpleCaseFolding by walking every code point of each operand, so an operand the
+size of `\p{L}` is measurable per `new BroilerRegex`. Profile representative successful,
+failing, catastrophic, lookaround, backreference, and UnicodeSet patterns before
+changing the model. Any optimization must
 retain explicit timeout/backtracking limits and identical capture/ordering semantics.
 
